--[[
   s.ick Aimbot v3.0
   New in v3:
   - Tabbed UI: Aimbot / Visuals / Settings tabs for a cleaner layout
   - Aim Key: hold a configurable key to activate aimbot (default: Right Mouse Button)
   - Smooth lerp aim with a real smoothness slider (vs. instant snap)
   - Aim part selector: Head / Neck / UpperTorso / HumanoidRootPart
   - Sticky target: click a name on the player list to lock onto them
   - ESP name tags with distance label above players' heads
   - Health bar below each player's name tag
   - Rainbow / solid highlight color mode toggle
   - Improved target score: blends distance, health, and screen-space FOV offset
   - Configurable triggerbot angle threshold slider
   - All previous v2.12 features retained (prediction, Kalman, 360° radar, team/wall/FOV checks)
]]--

